                  <num>235AA</num>
                  <heading>Terms and conditions of appointment of FRC members</heading>
                  <content>
                    <p>Remuneration and allowances</p>
                  </content>
                  <subsection eId="schedule-2__part-1__item-4__qstr-1__sec-235AA__subsec-1">
                    <num>1</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>A member of the FRC is to be paid the remuneration that is determined by the Remuneration Tribunal. If no determination of that remuneration by the Tribunal is in operation, the member is to be paid such remuneration as <role refersTo="#minister">the Minister</role> determines in writing.</p>
