                  <num>21</num>
                  <heading>Transitional provisions relating to the Corporations Legislation Amendment (Deregulatory and Other Measures) Act 2015</heading>
                  <section eId="schedule-2__part-2__item-1__qstr-1__part-21__sec-297">
                    <num>297</num>
                    <heading>Definitions</heading>
                    <content>
                      <p>In this Part:</p>
                      <p><term refersTo="#term-amending-act">amending Act</term> means <def>the Corporations Legislation Amendment (Deregulatory and Other Measures) Act 2015.</def></p>
                      <p><term refersTo="#term-commencement">commencement</term> means <def>the commencement of Schedule 2 to the amending Act.</def></p>
                    </content>
                  </section>
                  <section eId="schedule-2__part-2__item-1__qstr-1__part-21__sec-298">
                    <num>298</num>
                    <heading>FRC members</heading>
                    <subsection eId="schedule-2__part-2__item-1__qstr-1__part-21__sec-298__subsec-1">
                      <num>1</num>
                      <content>
                        <p>If:</p>
                      </content>
                      <paragraph eId="schedule-2__part-2__item-1__qstr-1__part-21__sec-298__subsec-1__para-a">
                        <num>a</num>
                        <content>
                          <p>immediately before commencement, a person is a member of the FRC; or</p>
                        </content>
                      </paragraph>
                      <paragraph eId="schedule-2__part-2__item-1__qstr-1__part-21__sec-298__subsec-1__para-b">
